Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДДСТА
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807}\fscy2007 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,nagtrabaho,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Gumawa sa serye:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}Paano ako naging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,pangalan,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.37,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Lahat ng character ay kathang-isip lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:08.54,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,at ang mga kaganapang ipinakita ay kathang-isip lamang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.13,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,18 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:15.81,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Teka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:17.71,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Tumigil!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:25.08,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.79,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Stop! Teka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:49.81,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Pumunta ba sa akin ang hari habang natutulog ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:51.68,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Oo, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:53.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi ito panaginip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.68,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Pero bakit ganito ang ugali niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:57.95,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Parang may humahabol sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.42,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Lalong nagiging maimpluwensya si Donghak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.86,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan ko, pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:06.99,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Huwag kang mag-alala, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Tama, malapit nang bumalik ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.50,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Tiyak na may dahilan kung bakit siya mabilis na umalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.44,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Siguraduhing okay ang lahat,\Nand come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Siyempre, mas mabuting pumunta kaagad kaysa maghintay hanggang dumating ako para magpaalam sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.44,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kaya siya umalis ng walang pasabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.59,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,May bagong may-ari na ang tronong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:43.49,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Maaari mo itong malaman kaagad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:46.66,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Lahat dahil ginawa ng reyna ang tamang pagpili.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.10,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.20,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Para sa kapakanan ng iyong anak
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:54.74,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,kinampihan niya ang pamilya, hindi ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.24,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Kung gayon, para sa kapakanan ng tagapagmana ng trono
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.35,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ipipikit ko ang aking mga mata sa mga kasalanan ng reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:09.02,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Sisiguraduhin kong hindi mo na kailangang mag-alala tungkol sa pakikipaglaban para sa trono.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.09,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.40,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gusto ko pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba kumakain ng marami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Nasasanay ang isang tao sa lahat ng bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.28,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ang pagkain noon ay walang lasa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,pero gusto ko na ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.45,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gaano man tayo kumain, hindi tayo makakakuha ng sapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.11,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Sa kabaligtaran, lumalala lang ang gutom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.88,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ang Munting Prinsipe ay matakaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay. Hindi ko na gagawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.70,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ok na ang lahat sa akin.\NBakit ganyan ang itsura mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:44.77,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong mamasyal.\NIMabuti ito para sa digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:47.17,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Pero tatapusin ko muna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.55,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Grabe ang panahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.46,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gusto kong kumuha ng litrato at ilagay ito sa isang frame at isabit sa dingding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.29,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Hindi pa huli para malutas
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:13.23,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,lahat ng hindi pagkakaunawaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.87,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Mamuhay tayo sa paraang gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:18.87,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:22.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang tunay kong anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:27.48,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Nag-alala ako, pero ngayon nakahanap ako ng paraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.91,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kaya huwag mo akong mahalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.78,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Pero mahal ko pa rin ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.85,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,At mamahalin kita, hayaan kang magkaroon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.12,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,lahat ng pagkukulang ng mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:39.72,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi ko maiwasang isipin siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.56,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot na lugar! alis na tayo dali!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.59,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,-Kamahalan!\N-Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.46,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.20,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Hindi isang lawa, ngunit isang kailaliman ng mga alaala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:05.25,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ngayon ang aming unang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Iminumungkahi ko ang isang alyansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.76,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Walang social distancing mula ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:27.90,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:31.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Oo, ang buong palasyong ito ay isang tuluy-tuloy na alaala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.55,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Bakit kakaunti ang tao?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.25,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Gaano katagal naging napakalaki ng palasyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.95,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Memories Strike Back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:54.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.74,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kamahalan,\Ndumating sa iyo ang Ministro ng Digmaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi kita nakita sa iyong mga silid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:14.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,May nangyari ba sa hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:15.75,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.26,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Nagdudugo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.73,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Saktan ang iyong sarili sa isang lugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.53,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Maliit na pinsala\Npagkatapos ng pagsasanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.77,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Alam kong gabi na,\Npero naparito ako para batiin ka sa iyong pagbubuntis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:37.84,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:41.34,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Huwag isipin ang muling pagsali sa clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:44.05,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,para sa kapakanan ng iyong anak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:47.22,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Akala ko napag-usapan na natin ang lahat noong nakaraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.79,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam na inabandona mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:52.86,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi pa rin kita tuluyang iiwan nang walang tulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:54.32,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ikaw at ang iyong sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.99,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,alam mo na hindi mo kayang mag-isa sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:02.90,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Salamat sa payo, ngunit hindi ako nag-iisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,At alam na alam mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.44,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Kung kailangan mo ng tulong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.31,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ako ay laging handa na ipahiram ang aking kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:12.48,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Para sa iyo at sa iyong anak
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.45,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.83,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kamakailan\Nnadagdagan ang galit ng mga tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.13,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Nakarating sa akin ang balita tungkol sa pag-aalsa ng mga magsasaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:39.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Balak kong personal\Nsiyasatin ang sitwasyon sa bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:43.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Lahat ng konektado sa mga tao ay mahalaga,\Nand habang wala ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:46.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,dapat mong sundin\Nang utos ng Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:50.45,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ito ang utos ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:59.69,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Dahil papalitan ko na ngayon ang hari sa pwesto, papalitan ko ang ilang opisyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.19,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,upang maisagawa nang maayos ang kanyang utos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:03.93,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Babalik si Kim Seokkeun
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.43,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,sa iyong post,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.66,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,at dating Ministro ng Digmaan na si Kim Changhyup
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.57,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,ay papalit sa ulo ng royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.20,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Prinsipe Yeonpyeong, na may hawak ng post na ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:15.31,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,focus\Non sa kanyang mga tungkulin bilang pinuno ng Ijeongcheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.43,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ang hari ay nagsimula sa isang mahirap na landas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.07,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Kung kahit isa ay sumubok\Nna masira ang kanyang reputasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:49.61,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,dapat\Nmatakot ang taong ito para sa kaligtasan ng kanyang wika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.38,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:27.74,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,ang cute mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:31.95,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Sa buhay na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.65,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,huwag tanggihan ang iyong sarili ng anuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:44.53,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ang sulat-kamay na sulat ay bagay lang\Nupang pakalmahin ang pusong suwail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.97,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Baby, miss mo na rin ba si daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Sabihin: “Tatay, bumalik ka kaagad!”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Sipa ​​ba talaga? Ganito ba ang sagot mo sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:02.51,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hindi ba masyadong maaga ang paggalaw ng prutas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Napakaaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.08,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Henyo ba ang bata?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:10.32,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Oh Diyos ko! Manganganak ako ng isang henyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:14.72,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,At bakit ako napakasaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:21.10,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:25.50,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,May nagsasabi sa akin\Nna ito ay magiging isang bangungot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.60,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ako ay magiging isang kakila-kilabot na magulang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.37,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,isang kakila-kilabot na krus sa pagitan ng isang mapagmahal na ama at isang baliw na ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.34,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ang iyong anak ay mahalaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.21,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Walang masyadong pag-aalaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:38.18,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong magiging kagaya mo ang sanggol...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.88,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng horror ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:42.22,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:46.82,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Bakit, kung katulad ko ang anak ko, grabe ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.29,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Oras na para uminom ng iyong gamot, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.47,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Sa ibaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.80,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Iyon lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Tinawag ng kanyang Kamahalan ang bata.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.78,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Iyon lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:21.99,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,At ano ang inihalo nila sa kanilang mga decoction?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:26.63,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Ang gamot na ito ay tiyak na laban sa pagkalaglag,\Nand hindi para sa dementia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:32.34,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Katatakutan! Anong klaseng mental attack ito?\NBakit ko ba siya iniisip?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.54,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Lahat ng bagay sa palasyo ay nagpapaalala sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.06,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hari namin si Cheoljong,\Ndito ko binuburdahan si CJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:59.00,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Burdahan mo ba talaga ito sa loob lang ng isang gabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.16,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Palagi itong kawili-wili\Nano ang makikita ng lahat sa pagbuburda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.40,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Habang abala ang aking mga kamay, walang laman ang aking ulo sa pag-iisip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:04.47,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gusto ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:06.84,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay isang tunay na manggagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Napakaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:11.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Ito ay sutla mula sa Jinju, Gyeongsangnam-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.81,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Akala ko, sa mahangin na mga araw
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,ang pinakamagandang isusuot ay tulad ng scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.85,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'm sure His Majesty\Nwill like your gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:21.15,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Narito ang isa pang scarf para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.52,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Naninigas ang lahat ng kalamnan dahil sa matagal na pag-upo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.92,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang maglaro ng isang bagay na masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:29.89,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,-Syempre, Kamahalan!\N-Siyempre, Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:32.13,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Punong Eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:38.67,Default,pinya 1,0,0,0,,Alam ko! Hari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.41,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Diyan mismo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:44.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:48.11,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Aba, oo, may isang punong bating na naglilingkod sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:50.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Oo, ito ang sagot - ang punong bating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.39,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,So, ibig sabihin? Hindi nakuha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.09,0:15:58.09,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Susunod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.69,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Tigre.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:01.72,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:02.79,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Unggoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:03.79,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:04.96,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Kuneho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.23,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Aso.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.30,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ito ay medyo madali.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.41,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Umuungol na parang inabandunang tuta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:16.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:19.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Namiss mo ba siya ng sobra?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.78,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Matataas na relasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Walang ganoon. Huwag mag-exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:32.96,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Lord, ano ang ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:36.13,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,, Kahit papaano hindi ito masaya. Bigyan mo ako ng karayom ​​at sinulid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:44.23,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Queen, okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:45.87,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.14,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hindi naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.61,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Napakasakit nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:55.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Paano masakit ang manipis na karayom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.42,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Lahat dahil sa hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.35,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Dahil sa pagbubuntis
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Madali akong magalit. At marami akong alalahanin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.42,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kaya patuloy akong umuungal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.59,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hindi ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:11.96,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ito ay mga hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:18.30,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Sobrang sakit ng puso ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:25.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Para siyang tinusok ng karayom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.01,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.15,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Naku, hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:36.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.62,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Hinahanap pa namin ang katawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.59,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Pakibigyan mo pa ako ng oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.03,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hindi na ako makapaghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:49.40,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Lalong dahilan para magmadali,\Nin kung sakaling buhay ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ihahayag ko ang kapalarang sinapit ng hari. Humanda ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:55.57,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.04,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ngayon handa na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:02.31,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hindi na ako paiiyakin ng ilang karayom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:05.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot na bangungot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Natakot ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.35,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Muntik na akong malaglag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.25,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Masasabi mo ba ang ganoong bagay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.16,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema? Tinatakot mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Nagdusa ba ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.27,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.81,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hari
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.28,0:18:35.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,umalis sa mundong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:57.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,At kung hindi ako nakatulog noong gabing iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.44,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Hari
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,umalis sa mundong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:16.42,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Paano kung hilingin kong manatili ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:21.12,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, bumalik ka sa amin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:25.93,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, bumalik ka sa amin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:31.67,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, bumalik ka sa amin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:35.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kung hindi pa ako nakarating sa Joseon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:38.91,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,at hindi tayo magkikita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:43.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Buhay ka pa sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:46.58,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,5 araw bago umakyat sa trono
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Bumalik?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.52,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Posible bang hilingin sa isang patay na bumalik?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.99,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot na kahilingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,At ang bangkay ay hindi pa nahahanap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:58.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ang sigaw na humihiling sa akin na bumalik ay nagpapatindig sa aking mga balahibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:02.23,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Kung kaya ko, magpuputong ako ng bagong hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.23,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ngunit kung hindi ako sumunod sa mga tradisyon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:06.14,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,at hintayin ang muling pagkabuhay ng namatay na hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:09.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Sigurado ako na ito ay magbabalik sa akin at masisira ang lahat ng aking mga plano sa pulitika.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kahit na ang hari ay buhay,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.94,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,hindi na siya makakabalik sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:16.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Isinara ko lahat ng gate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.65,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,hanggang sa bagong koronasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:20.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kung sa loob ng limang araw ay makakapagsagawa tayo ng koronasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,hindi na siya magiging hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:28.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kaya, kung papatayin natin siya, hindi na ito pagtataksil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:38.40,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Gaano katagal ako maghihintay hanggang sa matauhan ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:42.64,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Hindi ba talaga niya gustong makipag-reunite sa clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:45.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko sa kanya na maghanda at bisitahin ka
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:46.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.70,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Pregnancy Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,At bakit kailangan ito ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:21.54,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,kapag wala ka dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.97,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ang kapangyarihan ay binibili ng pera.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:57.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:01.08,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Huwag maging sensitibo sa amoy ng pagkain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:03.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Huwag gawing kumplikado ang buhay ng maganda mong mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:07.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Tumahimik hangga't gusto mo sa araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:11.09,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Pero kapag gustong matulog ng mommy mo, huminto ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:14.56,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Pagdating ng oras na lumabas sa mundo,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.83,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,lumabas kaagad,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.10,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,huwag masyadong pahirapan ang mommy mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.47,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ang pinakamahalagang bagay ay ang dumating sa mundo na malusog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:31.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'm really looking forward to the day when we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.02,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Nangangako ako na nasa tabi mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:43.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,kapag huminga ka muna sa mundong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:47.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kahit na parang kakaiba sa iyo ang mundo, huwag kang matakot sa anuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:34.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Magpakita ng paggalang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:38.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So ito ang plano mo noong una?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:42.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Alam ng hari ang tungkol sa panganib na nagbabanta sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:44.83,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Ngunit alang-alang sa iyong kaligtasan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.83,0:23:46.73,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,itinaya ang kanyang buhay at umalis sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:49.40,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.78,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Ipakulong si Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:02.88,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-Hindi!\N-Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:04.88,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:09.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Bakit mo inilalabas ang iyong galit sa reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:12.69,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Iniwan ng hari ang mundo dahil sa mga tagasunod ni Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.06,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ni hindi ginalaw ng mga rebelde ang gobernador.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:23.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Sabi mo nangahas silang patayin ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.93,0:24:27.24,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba maniniwala ako sa ganoong kalunus-lunos na kasinungalingan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:32.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin, pinatay ng iyong mga mandirigma ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:38.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Ikaw at ang reyna ang nagpahamak sa kanya sa kamatayan,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:41.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,kaya kailangan kong kitilin ang buhay niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:46.22,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Pakiusap, hindi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:47.66,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:50.73,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Para sa kapakanan ng bata sa kanyang tiyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:53.86,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,pakiusap huwag siyang saktan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:57.20,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Walang alam ang Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.63,0:24:58.80,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Pakiusap...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.54,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Nakikiusap ako sa iyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:14.55,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Panginoon! Reyna!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.89,0:25:22.19,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Alisin mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.64,0:25:39.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.05,0:25:44.58,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:47.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Pinatay ng mga sundalo mo ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:50.45,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Kayong dalawa, umalis na kayo sa kwarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.89,0:25:54.36,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Lahat ay maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:10.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Dapat may sisihin sa kasawiang nangyari.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.68,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Nagdedeliryo si Prince Yeonpyeong,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.31,0:26:17.15,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,huwag isapuso ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.78,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Bakit ipinakulong si Prinsipe Yeonpyeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:23.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,May ebidensya ako na bumitaw siya
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:24.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,mga tagasunod ni Tonhak, palihim na pumasok
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:27.79,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,sa royal guard, at tinulungan silang makatakas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.53,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Mukhang konektado sila sa nangyari sa hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.53,0:26:32.56,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,dahil tatanungin ko si Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:35.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Dapat ginawa ko ito ng mas maaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.67,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ano ba talaga ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:40.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Nagsalita ka na parang pinatay ni Prinsipe Yeonpyeong ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:43.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Tiyak na may nag-abot sa palasyo sa mga tagasunod ni Tonhak
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:46.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,impormasyon kung kailan aalis ang hari sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.64,0:26:51.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Dapat ay isang taong may access sa impormasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.71,0:26:53.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,na nangangahulugang ito ay malamang na si Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.99,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka ba na ang mga tagasunod ni Tonhak ang sumalakay sa hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:27:01.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Dapat kang tumuon sa kung ano ang mas mahalaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.46,0:27:06.06,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Ngayon ang angkan mo lang ang makakapagprotekta sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.06,0:27:07.43,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,at ang iyong anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.30,0:27:10.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Walang silbi ang pag-aalala tungkol sa anumang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:13.34,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Una kailangan mong makipagpayapaan sa dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:15.24,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Kung palalampasin mo ang pagkakataong ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:20.84,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,maaaring tuluyan kang mawalan ng pagkakataong ayusin ang relasyon sa clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:45.30,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Yeonpyeong, gusto kong maging ikaw sa kabilang buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,"Maghanap ng ebidensya." Parang simple lang
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.77,0:27:51.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,at kung gaano karaming trabaho ang kailangan nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:00.78,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nakikita kong nandito ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.09,0:28:06.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ay hindi ito angkop
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:10.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,nagtitipon sa bahay ng kisaeng nang mamatay ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:13.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sinadya kong pinili ang lugar na ito para makapagpahinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.83,0:28:18.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pwede tayong lahat maging tapat habang nandito tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:21.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamatayan ng Hari
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:25.27,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,kailangan nating magdiwang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:31.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Inom tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.18,0:28:35.89,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nababaliw na ang mga pulutong ng mga rebelde.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.15,0:28:38.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ako sa kinabukasan ni Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:41.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sa rate na ito, Tonkhakovites
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.86,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,Malapit nang mahuli ang Khanyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:47.83,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung mangyari ito, lahat ng nakaupo dito
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.87,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,ay magdurusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.03,0:28:54.60,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Samakatuwid, kailangan nating palakasin ang seguridad ng palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.90,0:28:57.84,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,at ang mga pader ng kuta sa paligid ng Khanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:01.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Magdedeklara kami ng state of emergency at paghihigpitan ang pagpasok.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.81,0:29:04.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang lahat ng kahina-hinalang tao ay ikukulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:07.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kaya aalisin natin ang lahat ng Tonhakite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:14.09,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.33,0:29:26.74,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mukhang nawala sa isip ang reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.84,0:29:29.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Palagi siyang ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.47,0:29:35.78,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,Akala niya nasa kamay niya ang lahat ng kapangyarihan dahil sa pagbubuntis,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:39.11,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,pero namatay ang hari. I bet takot na takot siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.65,0:29:43.25,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung manganak siya ng prinsipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:46.52,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,matatapos siya nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:50.36,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sa wakas, mga matatalinong salita mula sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kailangang baguhin ang mga kandila at insenso.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.83,0:30:34.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, mamamatay ako sa atake sa puso.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.47,0:30:37.51,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Bakit ganoon ang kanilang pagbabantay sa patay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.41,0:30:41.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Wala bang kakaiba dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.15,0:30:45.35,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kailangan na nating magmadali.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.25,0:30:49.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:09.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Siya ay malubhang nasugatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.11,0:31:12.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lalo na ang mukha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.27,0:31:16.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Napakalakas kaya hindi siya nakikilala.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.34,0:31:42.07,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.92,0:31:55.45,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hoy daga, wala akong ginawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.45,0:31:57.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lahat ng taong karapat-dapat makulong ay nagsasabi nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:32:00.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Guilty ka sa pagkawala ng iyong armas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:04.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano mo ako masisisi dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:07.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Anong tanga ang kayang mawalan ng armas?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.53,0:32:10.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kapareho ng nasa harap ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:12.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ninakawan ang weapons depot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:17.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko hindi ka interesado,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.11,0:32:21.54,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,kung ano ang kasalanan ni Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:24.91,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala. Wala ka dito ng matagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:27.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig sabihin nito? Kami
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.85,0:32:32.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,na-execute?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.96,0:32:36.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kaya kong umupo nang mas matagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.13,0:32:37.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gusto kong matulog sa sahig.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.13,0:32:38.46,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hoy, teka!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.63,0:32:45.70,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:49.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pag-usapan natin. Kaya natin ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.58,0:33:00.45,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pinadala ni Byonin si Cheoljong sa mga rebelde,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.45,0:33:02.35,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,ginagamit ako bilang pain para pumatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.65,0:33:06.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ngunit may ibang katawan doon, ibig sabihin
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:08.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,hindi gumana ang plano.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.13,0:33:14.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kinulong niya ang mga tao ni Cheoljong para hindi siya tulungang makabalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.90,0:33:25.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makapagconcentrate dahil sa paghikbi mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:33.18,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lumapit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.65,0:33:39.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko sa iyo ang isang sikreto.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:43.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Dapat mong dalhin siya sa iyong libingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.13,0:33:49.46,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:53.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.91,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Oo, siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.11,0:34:02.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang Kanyang Kamahalan ay mabubuhay sa iyong puso.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:04.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang iyong...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.91,0:34:07.92,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Naramdaman ko ang katawan mula ulo hanggang paa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.02,0:34:10.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hindi siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.42,0:34:12.39,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mula ulo hanggang paa?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:15.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lalaktawan ko ang mga detalye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.36,0:34:21.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Lord.\N-Kung siya ay buhay,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.73,0:34:24.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,bakit hindi ka pa bumabalik?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:27.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Siya ay nasugatan o nakatali sa isang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:30.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi.\N-Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.64,0:34:32.98,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,May batas na nagbabawal sa pag-akyat sa trono,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.98,0:34:35.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,pagkatapos kaagad ng pagkamatay ng hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:38.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Oo. Ang kaugaliang ito ay tinatawag na Sanibok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.28,0:34:42.15,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Dapat mong hintayin ang pagbabalik ng kaluluwa ng namatay sa loob ng limang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.15,0:34:44.59,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Maaari lamang umakyat sa trono ang bagong hari sa loob ng limang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:47.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung gayon mayroon kaming anim na araw, kasama ang araw ng koronasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:51.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gagawin nila ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.23,0:34:53.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,upang sa anim na araw na ito ay hindi bumalik ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:56.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ilan ang maid sa palasyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:35:01.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mga 250 court maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.44,0:35:03.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung isasama mo ang mga court servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.47,0:35:05.51,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,ay higit sa 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.11,0:35:08.74,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,600 live na surveillance camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.51,0:35:11.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung magsasabi ang bawat isa sa kanila, magkakaroon ng 600 salita.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:15.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gamitin natin sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.05,0:35:17.09,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Ano?\N-Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.09,0:35:19.15,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gagambalain ko ang koronasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:22.56,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kasama kita?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.06,0:35:24.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.46,0:35:26.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Oo.\N-Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:28.93,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.23,0:35:32.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung buhay ang Kanyang Kamahalan...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.37,0:35:38.07,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang ating estado ay dumaranas ng mga kahirapan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.47,0:35:40.48,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,hindi maaantala ang appointment ng isang bagong hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.84,0:35:43.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Bilang isang hari na gumaganap ng mga tungkulin ng hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:46.25,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ibinalita ko ang ika-32 na inapo
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.25,0:35:48.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Prinsipe Minheung, Lee Kyungwon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.22,0:35:52.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Iniwan ng hari ang mundong ito
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.26,0:35:54.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,dahil sa pag-aalsa ng mga rebelde...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.39,0:35:56.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tonghak followers na nag-alis
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:59.16,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,ang buhay ng ating hari, hindi karapat-dapat sa awa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.63,0:36:01.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ipinapahayag ko na bawat isa
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.53,0:36:04.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mawawasak ang mga tagasunod ng Tonghak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:07.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nagdala ng problema ang mga Tonhakovian sa kanilang sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.44,0:36:08.80,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mga bastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.38,0:36:19.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.89,0:36:26.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nagtagal
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:28.26,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Yeonpyeong at Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:30.73,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nagbabago ang balanse ng kapangyarihan
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.73,0:36:32.26,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,depende sa kung sino ang nasa trono.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.26,0:36:34.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hindi ito ang unang pagkakataon na nangyari ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:36.40,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,So be it. Kamakailan lamang ay namatay ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:38.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano mo mapipigil ang mga inosenteng tao?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.73,0:36:40.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Inosente?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.20,0:36:44.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang pagiging nasa panig ng mahihina ay isa ring krimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:48.08,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,Benin, hanggang saan ka handang pumunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.65,0:36:52.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gusto kong maging mas makapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.08,0:36:55.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Upang protektahan ang mga taong mahal ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.12,0:36:58.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ng higit pang kapangyarihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.73,0:37:07.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Gawing walang buhay ang iyong mga labi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:09.60,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Buhay na bangkay ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:12.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay gawin itong parang totoong bangkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.27,0:37:19.04,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Bakit umabot ng ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.94,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ako na lang ang natitira sa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:27.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kahit na gusto nila akong paalisin,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:29.68,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,hindi nila ilalagay ang isang buntis sa isang hawla.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.49,0:37:33.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ano ang hitsura ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:39.76,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Parang totoong bangkay.\N-Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.51,0:38:02.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Dumating na ang Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.38,0:38:35.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang dalawang ito ay magpapakita ng isang palabas dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:42.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ang pangunahing premyo lang ang magiging akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.63,0:38:48.43,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:54.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano mo ako iiwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:58.61,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano ang anak natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:01.14,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Iyong...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.61,0:39:06.01,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.55,0:39:13.32,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.46,0:39:14.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.89,0:39:17.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:21.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tawagan ang royal physician. Maagap!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:26.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.23,0:39:28.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kung maantala ako kahit saglit, isumpa ko sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:29.24,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I-drag, i-drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:32.87,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.11,0:39:36.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:43.42,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.69,0:39:46.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.26,0:39:49.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:54.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.37,0:39:58.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tinawagan mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.54,0:40:02.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Natakot ka ba nang marinig mo ang balita?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.34,0:40:05.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyari sa kanya sa mga huling araw?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.78,0:40:09.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Paano siya biglang umalis?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.71,0:40:12.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.59,0:40:17.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.59,0:40:21.02,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tumawag ako para sabihin ito sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.23,0:40:28.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.70,0:40:31.40,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.27,0:40:37.37,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Makinig.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.67,0:40:40.31,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Umpisa pa lang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.78,0:40:49.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Papakalmahin natin ang kaguluhan sa bansa sa loob ng apat na araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.75,0:40:53.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Salamat sa hari, aalisin natin ang mga Tonhakite.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.89,0:40:56.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ipagtatanggol ng iba sa hamak ang kanilang sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.39,0:40:59.76,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Dahil sa nangyayari, masasabi nating,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:01.83,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,na ibinigay niya ang kanyang buhay upang iligtas ang bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.10,0:41:08.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hanggang sa huminahon ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.57,0:41:13.21,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,may mga alalahanin,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.41,0:41:16.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,kaya nga kita tinipon dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:20.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Andong Kims at Phunyang Chos
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.62,0:41:22.45,Default,Si Lilia3,0,0,0,,ay magkaaway sa mahabang panahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.15,0:41:25.75,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Nagkaisa kami saglit,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.75,0:41:27.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,upang harapin ang karaniwang kaaway - ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:29.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ngunit ngayon ay umalis na ang hari sa laro,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.86,0:41:32.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,at natatakot akong mag-away muli ang magkabilang angkan
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:34.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,at makipagkumpitensya sa isa't isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:36.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Noon
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.33,0:41:39.20,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,tumayo tayo sa agenda,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.04,0:41:41.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Naghanda ako ng magpapalakas
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.97,0:41:43.64,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,unyon ng dalawang pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.28,0:41:55.58,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mutiny sa korte...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:00.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ilipat o ibagsak?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.22,0:42:03.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.73,0:42:06.09,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,na ikaw ay nagbabalak ng pagtataksil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.33,0:42:10.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ito ay nakatago sa kaibuturan ng iyong mga kaluluwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:12.90,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Patay na ang hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.90,0:42:15.20,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,bakit iiwan ang ganoong dokumento?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.20,0:42:17.61,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Upang ibahagi ang responsibilidad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.34,0:42:22.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pipigilan nito ang sinuman sa mga pamilya na lumabag sa mga tuntunin ng alyansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:24.71,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mag-iiwan ako ng ebidensya para bigyang-diin na tayo ay nasa iisang bangka.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.11,0:42:27.75,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Basta sumasang-ayon ka dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.35,0:42:31.92,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ginagarantiya ko na ang dalawang pamilya ay maaaring
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.99,0:42:34.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,coexist in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.49,0:42:36.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.46,0:42:40.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,na gusto mong kontrolin ang buhay namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.33,0:42:49.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hindi namin magagawa ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.01,0:42:57.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Ano ang pinapayagan mo sa iyong sarili?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How dare you gather soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.62,0:43:02.48,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Dapat kang sumang-ayon sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.99,0:43:06.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,upang makaalis dito ng buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.10,0:43:15.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kim Byunin
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.72,0:43:38.72,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:41.76,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Oo. Pumasok ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.43,0:43:50.57,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,-Kamahalan.\N-May nalaman ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.57,0:43:53.77,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Gaya ng sinabi mo, ang gate ng palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.97,0:43:58.14,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,at lahat ng gate sa paligid ng Hanyang ay sarado.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.17,0:44:00.24,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.14,0:44:02.31,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kumusta naman ang mga mandirigma?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.31,0:44:03.58,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Isang puwesto ang natitira,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.58,0:44:05.35,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,kung saan ipinagpatuloy ng mga mandirigma ang kanilang paghahanap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.05,0:44:07.82,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ito ay nasa tabi ng talampas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.62,0:44:11.75,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I found you, Cheoljong. Ililigtas kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:18.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,May nagpapaantok sa akin. Kailangan mo ring pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:24.50,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Gaano ko gustong matulog!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.94,0:44:29.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Mahihimatay ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.34,0:44:31.57,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Magandang gabi, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.97,0:44:33.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Matamis na panaginip, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.21,0:44:36.34,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Oo. Magandang gabi din sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:37.65,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.38,0:44:42.72,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Maging malusog.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.49,0:44:45.65,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.92,0:44:49.39,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Pagdating sa kalusugan, hindi ka dapat maging pabaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.73,0:44:52.99,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,-Oo, reyna.\N-Oo, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.99,0:45:27.00,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.03,0:45:29.10,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Nawalan siya ng malay dahil sa pagkabigla,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.10,0:45:30.27,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,pero mabilis siyang natauhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.60,0:45:31.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nawalan ng malay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:39.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Saan ka pupunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.52,0:45:56.02,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon ang iniisip ko, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.43,0:45:59.66,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Handa ka na ba talagang pumunta sa ganoong paraan?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.33,0:46:04.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,-Ituloy mo lang.\N-Hindi ka aalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.87,0:46:07.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung aalis ka sa palasyo, malalagay ka sa panganib.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.27,0:46:08.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo hindi ko alam ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.20,0:46:10.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Alam ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.41,0:46:12.71,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Ginamit mo ako bilang pain para sa hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.71,0:46:15.08,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,at ikaw ang nakatutok sa kanya ng espada.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:17.45,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Alam ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.65,0:46:19.88,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Basta ligtas ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.88,0:46:21.85,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Handa akong tiisin ang iyong poot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:24.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Magalit ka sa akin hangga't gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:25.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,At sumuko na.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.42,0:46:28.26,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Patay na rin ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.26,0:46:30.79,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,No. Siya ay buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.79,0:46:34.30,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Alam mo, hindi isa ang hari sa mga madaling mamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.66,0:46:37.07,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Hindi kaya nagmamadali ka sa koronasyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.07,0:46:38.17,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.37,0:46:40.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Pakiusap.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.07,0:46:44.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Dapat kang tumalikod sa hari para mabuhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:49.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Gusto mong malaman kung bakit ko pinili ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.61,0:46:52.58,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sagutin kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:55.25,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung sinuman ang karapat-dapat na maging hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.62,0:46:57.52,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,pagkatapos ay ang Kanyang Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.32,0:47:00.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Siya ang pinakaangkop na kandidato.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:04.86,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kaya huwag mo nang subukang pumili para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.86,0:47:05.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung magpapatuloy ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:14.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,hindi mo ako iiwan ng pagpipilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.94,0:47:18.94,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Soyeon, paano mo ako ituturo ng arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.17,0:47:20.64,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Alam mo ang nararamdaman ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.88,0:47:24.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kung mahal na mahal mo siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.81,0:47:26.88,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,hindi ko ba dapat naintindihan,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:28.72,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,na nagbago si Kim So-yeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.42,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.69,0:47:35.69,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,, Ako ba talaga ang babaeng pinapangarap mo all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.69,0:47:38.23,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Isa akong ganap na ibang tao sa loob, ngunit hindi mo alam iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.76,0:47:40.06,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Yung minahal mo, -
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:42.83,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,isang shell lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.86,0:47:44.80,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,-Soyeon.\N-Ang totoong Soyeon, na minahal mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.80,0:47:46.17,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,wala na.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:49.44,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano ang pinagsasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.74,0:47:57.25,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi ka kayang barilin ng totoong Soyeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:47:59.98,Default,tira4,0,0,0,,dahil minahal kita na parang kapatid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.12,0:48:02.42,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Pero iba ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.02,0:48:07.12,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kaya kitang barilin hangga't gusto ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.77,0:48:20.10,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Binalaan kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.67,0:48:23.37,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Ayokong masaktan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.95,0:49:04.98,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:08.92,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ito ay napakalinaw na nagpasya kaming ito ay isang pahiwatig.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.42,0:49:11.52,Default,shooting room4,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dahil gusto kong mabuhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:15.06,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kapag hindi kita nakikita, pakiramdam ko mamamatay ako sa pagkabalisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:18.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kalimutan at bumalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.69,0:49:20.90,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.00,0:49:23.36,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung gusto mong pumunta mag-isa, kailangan mo akong tapakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.91,0:49:34.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Apat na araw na lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.94,0:49:38.68,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Coronation sa loob ng apat na araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.68,0:49:40.95,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Paano ka maghahanap sa buong kagubatan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.95,0:49:43.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,at hahanapin mo bang mag-isa ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.92,0:49:47.16,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nakangiti ka ba ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.39,0:49:48.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Oo, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.02,0:49:50.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Maraming ligaw na hayop sa kabundukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.93,0:49:52.63,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi ka magtatagal doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.86,0:49:54.60,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Maaaring kainin ka ng mga lobo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:57.97,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,O maaaring mahanap ng mga mandirigma ang iyong nakapirming katawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.70,0:50:02.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Paano kaya. Nakakatakot kaya! Literal na nanginginig ako sa takot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.47,0:50:04.01,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Say what you want: huwag mo akong takutin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.17,0:50:06.21,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Bumalik tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.41,0:50:08.58,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Dahil ayaw ng reyna na sumama tayo sa kanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:11.48,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,parusahan tayo dahil hindi natin siya napigilan,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.71,0:50:14.52,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,pipilitin tayong inumin ang tasa ng lason,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:17.85,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,at mahuhulog tayo sa walang hanggang pagtulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:34.30,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Okay. Maaari kang sumama sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.11,0:50:39.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi ito bakasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.37,0:50:40.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,bakit mo ito kailangan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.74,0:50:43.08,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Paano mo dadaan ang kuta sa Hanyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.21,0:50:47.22,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Akala ko tumalon na lang ako sa pader,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.22,0:50:49.15,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,pero ngayon dahil sa iyo hindi ito gagana sa ganoong paraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.22,0:50:53.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Napakataas ng kuta sa Hanyang, paano mo ito tatalunin?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.19,0:50:56.52,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Tinatawanan mo na naman ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.36,0:51:01.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Naayos na namin ang lahat. Wala kang dapat ipag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.85,0:51:16.08,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.37,0:51:26.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Akala ko magse-celebrate tayo,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.41,0:51:29.51,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,ngunit kung tutuusin sa iyong mukha, hinuhusgahan mo ang pagkatalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:31.51,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Anong sugat ang kaya mong pagalingin ng ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:33.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Saan ka nasaktan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.72,0:51:38.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Touch my cup again,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.95,0:51:41.49,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,at puputulin ko ang iyong kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:48.43,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kung mahal na mahal mo siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.82,0:51:50.66,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,hindi ko ba dapat naintindihan,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.89,0:51:52.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,na nagbago si Kim So-yeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.37,0:51:56.26,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kagabi kamukha mo talaga siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.91,0:52:01.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano? Pag-ibig?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:03.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nakakasuklam!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.18,0:52:05.55,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nalilito na ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.55,0:52:06.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,at pag-ibig ang pinag-uusapan mo rito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.91,0:52:31.11,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Huli ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.70,0:52:34.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Pumunta sa iyong kwarto at magpahinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.70,0:52:37.14,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nakabukas ang kalan, kaya magiging mainit ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.55,0:52:40.22,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka nagtatanong ng kahit ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.09,0:52:42.78,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Dahil isa akong ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:54.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginawa nila?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.93,0:52:57.70,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Liham na may plano para sa pagtataksil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.09,0:53:00.87,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Na hindi ko alam? Sobrang risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.87,0:53:02.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling makuha natin ito, ito ang magiging sandata natin,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.91,0:53:04.24,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,kaya huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.64,0:53:06.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Dadalhin ko ito sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.74,0:53:08.05,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay inakusahan ng pagtataksil.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.05,0:53:10.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung babalik ka kaagad pagkatapos mawala ang hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.87,0:53:13.24,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,ito ay magiging kahina-hinala.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.72,0:53:15.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ayoko nang bumalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.24,0:53:18.01,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Magiging masaya ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.86,0:53:22.28,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,kung patuloy kitang matutulungan mula sa mga anino.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.62,0:53:29.12,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Nga pala, narinig ko na lumabas ng palasyo ang reyna sa gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.97,0:53:32.39,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,How dare she run away in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.66,0:53:35.61,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sinabi kahit kanino ang tungkol dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.91,0:53:37.30,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,pero alam mo na ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.47,0:53:40.24,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Alam kung ano ang maaaring maging reyna,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.70,0:53:42.91,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Hindi ko akalain na tumakas lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.68,0:53:44.82,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Bakit kung ganoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:49.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong gusto niyang mahanap ang hari para ibalik ang lahat sa lugar nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.34,0:53:54.68,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Dapat makasigurado siyang buhay ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.62,0:53:59.30,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Dapat may dahilan siya para paniwalaan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.30,0:54:02.07,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Naghubad siya ng damit at lumabas ng palasyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.07,0:54:03.30,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,ibig sabihin
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.49,0:54:07.03,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,ngayon isa na lang siyang ordinaryong babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.30,0:54:09.20,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kahit alam niyang nagsisinungaling siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.20,0:54:12.11,Default,tira4,0,0,0,,Sinubukan kong tanggapin siya alang-alang kay Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.53,0:54:15.97,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Mukhang mahal na mahal ng royal couple ang isa't isa,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.74,0:54:20.34,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,kaya bakit hindi natin sila ilibing nang magkasama.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.49,0:54:24.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Alagaan mo ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.57,0:54:37.59,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.97,0:54:40.87,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Bumalik ako para tulungan ang Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.37,0:54:46.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Ito ba ang mga responsable sa pagkamatay ng hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.74,0:54:47.80,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.80,0:54:49.68,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Nag-iipon lang kami ng mga halamang gamot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.84,0:54:52.34,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Hindi pa namin nakilala ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.24,0:54:56.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ito pala, mga walang ugat na nilalang
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.72,0:54:59.01,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,nakahuli ng dragon nang hindi man lang namamalayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.32,0:55:27.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Tumalon ka nang husto, tila okay na ang lahat sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:29.55,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Akala ko patay ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:31.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.05,0:55:33.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ano sa tingin mo? Herbalist, malinaw naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.72,0:55:35.66,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Bakit pa ako titira sa kagubatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:38.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba ang nagligtas sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.86,0:55:43.32,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Hindi talaga. Sabihin na nating nahanap kita at dinala dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.62,0:55:45.24,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Nagsusuot ka ng mamahaling damit,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.24,0:55:47.16,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,kaya akala ko ikaw
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.16,0:55:49.01,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,bayaran mo ako sa pagligtas sa buhay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.01,0:55:50.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong bayaran ang lahat, alam mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.78,0:55:53.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ngunit wala ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.74,0:55:56.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Mukhang mahal ang tela,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.11,0:55:58.82,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi ko maibenta ang basahan na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.18,0:56:01.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Nasunog ko lang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.78,0:56:03.78,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Sunog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.78,0:56:07.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,May mga mandirigma na naglalakad kung saan-saan at naghahanap ng kung ano.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.45,0:56:11.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Mali ba ako na dinala ka dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.43,0:56:14.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Collector!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:18.26,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Kung tumakas ka nang hindi nagbabayad,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.26,0:56:20.09,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Puputulin ko ang iyong mga kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.74,0:56:22.84,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Tandaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.72,0:56:36.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Dinala ko sa iyo ang pinakamahusay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:55.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,So, so, and what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.47,0:56:58.18,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,So, sa oras ng libing gumagamit sila ng bangkay ng iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.18,0:57:00.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Kung maaari silang magsagawa ng koronasyon sa loob ng 6 na araw,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.55,0:57:02.57,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.55,0:57:05.12,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Paano mo nalaman ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.12,0:57:07.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Napaka predictable ng mga idiot na ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.09,0:57:10.84,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Ang mga idiot na ito ay nararapat na parusahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.80,0:57:25.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ito ang pag-amin ng isang tagasunod ni Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.24,0:57:28.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Mayroon na akong ideya kung sino ang dapat sisihin dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.07,0:57:30.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hanapin ang tamang sandali pagkatapos ng koronasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.70,0:57:32.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,upang ipahayag ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:35.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.82,0:57:40.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maaari ko bang hilingin sa iyo na bantayan ang mga guwardiya ng palasyo sa ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.74,0:57:42.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.14,0:57:45.41,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Gusto ko mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.18,0:57:49.95,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,dalhin ang mga ulo ng hari at reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.99,0:58:00.26,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,3 araw bago ang koronasyon
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.30,0:58:03.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Benin!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.07,0:58:08.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pupunta ka ba sa paghahanap ng reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.07,0:58:11.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit siya umalis sa palasyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.28,0:58:14.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Dapat alam mo ang dahilan, sobrang close kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.95,0:58:18.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ang Reyna ay hindi na ang Soyeon na kilala ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.41,0:58:20.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.20,0:58:41.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Dapat kong ibalik ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.64,0:58:45.22,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Isang uri ng manipis na lock. Baka mabuksan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.28,0:58:54.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Dapat may pangalawang constipation sa isang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.39,0:58:55.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nagulat ako na binuksan mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.78,0:58:56.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.39,0:59:04.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.34,0:59:07.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakarating dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.20,0:59:10.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alam mo, kaibigan ko lahat ng tao sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:14.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Na-lock ka dito dahil kaibigan lang kayo ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.68,0:59:16.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala tungkol sa anumang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.24,0:59:19.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ilalabas kita, anuman ang mangyari.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.87,0:59:21.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay isang tunay na kaibigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.24,0:59:25.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ang iyong debosyon ay hindi natitinag kahit na sa ganitong delikadong sitwasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.51,0:59:27.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.22,0:59:31.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nakipagkaibigan ka sa akin hindi dahil ako ay mula sa Andonian Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.55,0:59:34.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At naging kaibigan kita hindi dahil malapit kang kaibigan ng hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.89,0:59:38.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Eksakto.\N-Ang bagay ay,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.24,0:59:40.49,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,na ngayon ay ganap na kaguluhan sa palasyo,\N at higit pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.97,0:59:43.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Gusto nilang i-pin ang pagpatay sa hari sa mga tagasunod ni Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.57,0:59:46.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Natatakot akong magdusa ang mga inosenteng tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.43,0:59:48.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Kahit ang reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.57,0:59:52.34,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,biglang nawala sa kalagitnaan ng gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.32,0:59:57.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin na nawala ang reyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.76,1:00:00.49,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Nawala siya sa palasyo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.12,1:00:03.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,kasama ang court lady at ang maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:06.39,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Kakaalis lang ni Benin sa palasyo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.39,1:00:08.66,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,para hanapin siya,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.80,1:00:11.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,pero naabala ako sa itsura niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.99,1:00:13.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nag-abala?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.24,1:00:15.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Siguro ginagawa ko ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.24,1:00:17.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,pero ganito siya,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.30,1:00:20.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,parang gusto niya itong punitin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.57,1:00:28.62,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:34.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano? Para saan?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:36.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.57,1:00:42.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ngayon ay maayos na ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.89,1:00:44.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.97,1:00:47.57,Default,Spillkins,0,0,0,,Ano iyon, Lady Choi? Tinakot mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.01,1:00:51.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong laging mag-ingat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.03,1:00:54.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.64,1:00:58.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Lagi kang maingat. Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:01:00.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Go, move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.34,1:01:02.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tulungan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.91,1:01:05.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Mangyaring mag-ingat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.05,1:01:09.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wow, hindi ako makapaniwalang marami kang dala!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.78,1:01:10.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.43,1:01:13.03,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Candied bell root.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.36,1:01:14.59,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Candied bell root?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.59,1:01:17.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Natanggap ko ang mga ito mula sa isang taong espesyal at pinahahalagahan ko sila nang husto.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.49,1:01:19.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maaari mo itong tanggapin, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:21.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Pagkatapos ay susubukan ko ang isa.\N-Siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.41,1:01:26.93,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Isang himala kung gaano ito kasarap. Subukan ang isa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:28.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young, at ikaw?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.61,1:01:30.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Well, okay.\N-Eto, subukan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.30,1:01:31.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.34,1:01:33.47,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Napakasarap nito.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.39,1:01:41.09,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi! Paano kaya?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.09,1:01:42.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Okay lang ako.\N-Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.30,1:01:46.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oo, maayos ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:49.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,God, ayos lang ako, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.99,1:01:51.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Move on.\N-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.07,1:01:56.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang hari?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.74,1:02:00.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, ikaw ay pinalaki na parang pinong bulaklak.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.84,1:02:02.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kumportable ka ba talagang matulog ng ganyan?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:04.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Oo. Ginawa ko ito ng maraming beses.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:07.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Talaga? Ikaw?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.09,1:02:09.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kahit na hindi ko kinailangan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.91,1:02:11.91,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,I-drop ito. Ito ay kalokohan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.91,1:02:14.01,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Nakagawa ka na ba ng forced march na 400 km na may load na 50 kg?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.68,1:02:15.78,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,400 kilometro?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.09,1:02:22.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nakakapangarap. 400 km? Halika na.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:25.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes, medyo pinalaki ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.43,1:02:26.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Pero siguradong lampas na ito sa 200.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:29.11,Default,Spikilka,0,0,0,,Sa panahon ng mga operasyon sa taglamig, natunaw kami ng yelo at umiinom...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.57,1:02:33.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes, well, yes. Naniniwala kami, naniniwala kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.80,1:02:37.20,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hoy! Seryoso talaga ako!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:39.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Siyempre, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.51,1:02:41.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Ayokong sipon ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.78,1:02:44.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi tayo makakagawa ng apoy nang hindi nahuhuli.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.51,1:02:47.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ako kung paano tayo matutulog sa napakalamig na gabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.76,1:02:50.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sayang naman itong pinagdadaanan mo, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.43,1:02:53.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kalokohan ito. At hindi naman malamig.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.45,1:02:55.47,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Walang maihahambing sa aming mga operasyon sa taglamig.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.20,1:02:59.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.49,1:03:28.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I-off ang aircon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.39,1:03:31.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Baka sipon ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.53,1:04:31.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi namin siya nakita.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.45,1:04:34.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hati sa mga grupo at suklayin ang buong bundok.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:35.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Oo!\N-Oo!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.86,1:05:01.09,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Para sa ilang kadahilanan, maganda ang pakiramdam ko ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.86,1:05:05.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sa sikat ng araw na ito, naniniwala ako na ngayon ay mahahanap natin ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.47,1:05:18.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Wala kaming oras para dito. Sige.\N-Oo, tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.11,1:05:21.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Bilisan na natin.\N-Kailangan na nating magmadali.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.95,1:05:24.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Ito ba ang daan?\N-Oo, reyna. Mag-move on na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.01,1:05:30.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Malapit na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.34,1:05:32.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Malapit na tayong makarating sa bangin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.12,1:05:35.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang sobrang kumpiyansa sa iyong 20s.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.26,1:05:37.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ang enerhiya ay nagmamadali!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.09,1:05:41.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Magpahinga muna tayo.\N-Oo, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.01,1:05:53.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Dapat kong sabihin, ang mundo ay mas maliwanag ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:57.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,kapag nasa labas na kami ng palasyo, reyna.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.74,1:06:02.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At bago niya kinasusuklaman na umalis sa palasyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.28,1:06:03.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.05,1:06:06.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,At ikaw, Hong Young?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.26,1:06:07.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alin ang mas gusto mo?\NAng palasyo o sa labas nito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.86,1:06:10.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nasaan ka, Kamahalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.28,1:06:13.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Iyan ang sinabi niya.\N-Hoy, itigil mo na.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.14,1:06:20.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Queen, nandito sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.66,1:06:23.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Narito sila. Sunggaban sila!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.16,1:06:24.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Tumakbo, kailangan mong magtago!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.51,1:06:25.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Okay.\N-Tumakbo!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:30.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young, samahan mo ang reyna. Takbo!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:33.28,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Lady Choi, saan ka pupunta? saan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.01,1:06:36.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don't you dare, geeks! hindi ako papayag!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.72,1:06:38.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, kailangan nating tumakbo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.45,1:06:40.62,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Court Lady Choi!\N-Hindi kita papasukin!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.62,1:06:41.78,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Bitawan mo ako!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.36,1:06:44.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.55,1:06:48.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.76,1:06:51.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bumalik!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:06.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Court lady Choi!\N-Queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.74,1:07:07.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi, pakiusap!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.84,1:07:10.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kunin mo sila!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.18,1:07:12.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nakikiusap ako, huminto ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.38,1:07:16.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hindi! Hindi na kailangan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.96,1:07:20.20,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi!\N-Queen! pakiusap...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.92,1:07:24.50,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi!\N-Hindi. Hindi!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.33,1:07:30.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Hindi! Court Lady Choi!\N-Kailangan nating tumakas, reyna!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.63,1:07:31.88,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.28,1:07:35.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.71,1:07:39.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Run! Reyna, nakikiusap ako, tumakbo ka!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.83,1:07:52.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, sana mahanap mo ang hari.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:07:58.33,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Hon Young!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.26,1:08:00.33,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Sundan mo siya!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.21,1:09:23.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.25,1:09:28.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginawa mo kay Soyeon?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.63,1:09:47.91,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Paano ako naging reyna
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.86,1:10:10.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Sabi mo alam mo ang lahat tungkol sa akin at kay Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.59,1:10:13.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Bigla silang bumalik sa akin
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.17,1:10:14.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,lahat ng alaala niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.50,1:10:21.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Nabubuhay pa rin si Soyeon sa loob mo kung mapangalagaan ang kanyang mga alaala.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:24.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hawakan mo ang kamay ko hanggang sa makalabas ka ng hindi nasaktan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.00,1:10:27.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Alam ko. Sarili mo lang iniisip mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.54,1:10:30.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Kunin sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.68,1:10:32.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Sundan ang reyna!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,

Komento: 0,0:39:42.84,0:39:43.84,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Okay.
Komento: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:04.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Pag-alis o pagbagsak ng hari
